<title>USA: Omnipoint, Brightpoint in pact.</title>
<headline>Omnipoint, Brightpoint in pact.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnipoint Communications Inc said Wednesday it entered into a non-exclusive contract with Brightpoint Inc to distribute wholesale Omnipoint's personal communications services business.</p>
<p>Omnipoint Communications is a unit of Omnipoint Corp.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
